1
00:00:02,125 --> 00:00:03,125
Hurry!

2
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,291
Looks like they haven't gone far.

3
00:00:35,875 --> 00:00:36,875
We need to find him as soon as possible,

4
00:00:37,541 --> 00:00:38,901
and take him back for experiments.

5
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:48,500
"The Last Oath"

6
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:53,400
(Episode 11: Last Message)

7
00:03:10,916 --> 00:03:12,291
They're looking for someone.

8
00:03:16,458 --> 00:03:17,875
They're looking for you.

9
00:03:25,458 --> 00:03:26,833
Why are they after you?

10
00:03:29,125 --> 00:03:30,500
They're Casia's men.

11
00:03:34,458 --> 00:03:35,458
After the apocalypse,

12
00:03:35,625 --> 00:03:37,583
they forced me to work on the zombie virus.

13
00:03:38,416 --> 00:03:39,666
I barely made it out alive.

14
00:03:40,166 --> 00:03:41,541
I don't want to be dragged back.

15
00:03:42,833 --> 00:03:44,416
You research the zombie virus?

16
00:03:47,833 --> 00:03:48,833
They're still nearby.

17
00:03:49,208 --> 00:03:50,208
Whatever you want to say,

18
00:03:50,416 --> 00:03:51,416
save it for later.

19
00:03:51,916 --> 00:03:53,083
Since there's no gas in T1,

20
00:03:53,333 --> 00:03:54,750
we might as well check T2.

21
00:04:00,958 --> 00:04:01,958
Let's go.

22
00:04:22,708 --> 00:04:23,832
All the way here,

23
00:04:23,833 --> 00:04:25,473
it doesn't look like anyone's lived here.

24
00:04:30,458 --> 00:04:31,625
But don't worry.

25
00:04:32,625 --> 00:04:33,541
Your brother

26
00:04:33,625 --> 00:04:35,458
most likely went
somewhere else for shelter.

27
00:04:38,541 --> 00:04:39,666
Let's find some gas first.

28
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:40,990
Once we have gas, we can leave.

29
00:04:41,125 --> 00:04:42,583
I'll go look for him elsewhere too.

30
00:05:12,625 --> 00:05:13,625
He Yao,

31
00:05:13,916 --> 00:05:16,434
you said earlier that things haven't
changed since the apocalypse.

32
00:05:16,458 --> 00:05:17,458
What did you mean?

33
00:05:21,125 --> 00:05:23,750
Casia tied themselves to armed
groups after the apocalypse.

34
00:05:24,041 --> 00:05:25,208
They provide protection,

35
00:05:25,666 --> 00:05:28,166
but they also guard
the lab like a fortress.

36
00:05:29,541 --> 00:05:30,582
People like me

37
00:05:30,583 --> 00:05:32,303
are no different from high-level prisoners.

38
00:05:32,708 --> 00:05:33,708
The research direction

39
00:05:34,250 --> 00:05:35,541
isn't something we can decide.

40
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,541
Has there been any actual progress?

41
00:05:46,250 --> 00:05:47,666
We have some theoretical models,

42
00:05:48,375 --> 00:05:49,875
but we're still a long way off

43
00:05:50,708 --> 00:05:51,916
from a real antibody.

44
00:05:56,041 --> 00:05:57,041
Did you find it?

45
00:05:59,125 --> 00:06:00,125
Nothing here.

46
00:06:01,833 --> 00:06:02,833
I'll go check over there.

47
00:06:11,708 --> 00:06:14,250
Keep it down, or you'll
draw the zombies here.

48
00:06:14,750 --> 00:06:17,041
So what? If they come,
it's just target practice.

49
00:06:37,708 --> 00:06:38,708
He Yao!

50
00:06:39,750 --> 00:06:40,750
Let's go!

51
00:08:43,625 --> 00:08:44,625
Are you okay?

52
00:08:45,958 --> 00:08:46,958
I'm fine.

53
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,400
There are two more guys over there.

54
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:30,500
Wait for me here.

55
00:10:17,083 --> 00:10:18,083
Let's get out of here.

56
00:11:12,708 --> 00:11:14,125
That bastard, He Yao.

57
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:16,140
He was trying to steal our car all along.

58
00:11:16,958 --> 00:11:18,598
Let's just get out of this airport first.

59
00:12:09,041 --> 00:12:10,083
Alright, alright.

60
00:12:10,625 --> 00:12:11,791
It's okay, it's okay.

61
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:20,791
You're safe now.

62
00:12:39,833 --> 00:12:40,833
Where are we?

63
00:12:42,166 --> 00:12:43,166
In a car.

64
00:12:47,791 --> 00:12:50,125
I'm not so out of it that
I can't tell we're in a car.

65
00:12:51,208 --> 00:12:52,208
I mean,

66
00:12:53,541 --> 00:12:54,875
where are you taking me?

67
00:12:57,583 --> 00:12:59,000
To find a safe place for you.

68
00:13:00,333 --> 00:13:01,613
Then we'll figure something out.

69
00:13:09,708 --> 00:13:11,333
Don't ever feed me your blood again.

70
00:13:13,375 --> 00:13:14,375
He Yao.

71
00:13:16,166 --> 00:13:17,750
Are you still not going to give up?

72
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:21,250
I will never give up.

73
00:13:21,791 --> 00:13:22,832
Not unless I'm dead.

74
00:13:22,833 --> 00:13:24,073
I'm the one who's already dead.

75
00:13:24,750 --> 00:13:26,708
Haven't you accepted reality yet?

76
00:13:26,916 --> 00:13:28,291
You're not like them.

77
00:13:28,541 --> 00:13:29,833
You're just sick.

78
00:13:33,333 --> 00:13:34,333
He Yao.

79
00:13:35,375 --> 00:13:37,208
Don't use curing me

80
00:13:37,708 --> 00:13:39,375
to prove you're better than me.

81
00:13:40,291 --> 00:13:41,750
Can't I just admit defeat?

82
00:13:46,333 --> 00:13:47,999
Then the loser should
do as the winner says.

83
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,000
I'm a zombie.

84
00:13:49,541 --> 00:13:51,458
I could bite you at any moment.

85
00:13:51,833 --> 00:13:53,124
Why do you insist on staying with

86
00:13:53,125 --> 00:13:54,625
a walking corpse like me?

87
00:13:56,125 --> 00:13:58,165
Drop your damn obsession with winning.

88
00:13:58,166 --> 00:13:59,926
I'm not as obsessed
with winning as you are.

89
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,476
You were the one who
wanted to beat me so badly

90
00:14:02,500 --> 00:14:03,458
that you insisted on
experimenting on yourself.

91
00:14:03,459 --> 00:14:04,875
That's why you ended up like this.

92
00:14:05,958 --> 00:14:07,500
This was my own choice.

93
00:14:08,458 --> 00:14:09,818
I'll bear the consequences myself.

94
00:14:10,583 --> 00:14:11,916
It has nothing to do with you.

95
00:14:13,333 --> 00:14:15,041
Well, this is my choice too.

96
00:14:15,791 --> 00:14:17,311
And I'll bear the consequences myself.

97
00:14:19,166 --> 00:14:20,208
You're crazy.

98
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,440
I lost my damn mind a long time ago.

99
00:14:30,916 --> 00:14:31,916
Fine.

100
00:15:17,291 --> 00:15:18,291
A-Leh.

101
00:15:20,958 --> 00:15:21,958
You have a fever.
